$(function(){$(window).on("load scroll",function(){if($(window).scrollTop()>740){$(".navbar").addClass("fixed")}else{$(".navbar").removeClass("fixed")}});$("a").each(function(){var a=this;if(a.origin!==location.origin){$(a).attr("target","_blank")}});$("a[href^=#]").click(function(){var scrollHref=$(this).attr("href");var scrollPosition=$(scrollHref).offset().top;$("html,body").animate({scrollTop:scrollPosition},"700");return false});var $ctaPanel=$("#ctaPanel");$(".js-install-btn").on("click",function(e){e.preventDefault();$(this).closest(".btn-wrapper").append($ctaPanel);$ctaPanel.addClass("is-active");e.stopPropagation()});$(document).on("click",function(e){if(!$(e.target).closest("#ctaPanel").length){$ctaPanel.removeClass("is-active")}});$(document).on("keydown",function(e){if(e.key==="Escape"){$ctaPanel.removeClass("is-active")}})});